    "biography": "<p><strong>Type:</strong> Smart Animal</p><p><strong>Niche:</strong> Transhuman Habitats</p><p><strong>Numbers:</strong> 1–20</p><p>Transhumans keep uplifted rats as companions, sometimes carrying them in pockets or hoods.</p><p><strong>Traits:</strong> Very Small Size (−30 to hit)</p><p><strong>Notes:</strong> A large number of rats might attack as a swarm (p. 168) with Bite 50, DV 1d10 +3,AP −3, and Durability 30.</p><p><strong>Bite:</strong> 20, DV 1, Reach (−10)</p><p><em>Initiative printed: 6 (X-Risks uses (INT + REF) ÷ 5); Wound Threshold 1, Death Rating 8.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase X-Risks, p. 161.</em></p>",
